+- ROOT CAUSE: The observer guard denied selected process/network calls but admitted production `os.ReadFile` access to user configuration. `pkg/vendorplugin/observer_no_live_test.go`.
+- FIX: The composed production/test boundary now permits only its reviewed pure imports; filesystem, process, network, local-runtime, and future unreviewed dependencies fail closed.
