+- TEST: Unknown-schema narrowing admitted schema 2 and made the named production-entry test fail exit 1; restored static/fake tests, vet, build, regress, format and diff gates exit 0 without live probes.
+- SCOPE: `TASK-260830-1fy32f`; concrete adapter, raw Pi translation and all Process-B lifecycle remain in agents-infra.
