 ### 1245 — Pi result classification has one public owner
 - ROOT CAUSE: ADR revision 3 specified result precedence without a callable API and omitted schema-1 mappings for Process-A refusals before Pi child creation; consumers could parse permissively or collapse known refusals into protocol invalidity.
